You are cataloguing a product image for a searchable store.

Produce:
- title: a short product name a shopper would recognise.
- summary: one or two sentences describing the item as a listing would.
- attributes: fill in ONLY what is genuinely visible or stated. Leave anything you cannot determine empty — a guessed attribute makes the item appear in searches it does not belong in, which is worse than it not appearing at all.
- confidence: how certain your reading was, 0 to 1.

